        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kalyanji Virji Shah, Anandji Virji Shah\n- Projects: Kalyanji–Anandji discography\n- Roles: Bollywood composer duo, music director\n- Awards: Filmfare Award for Best Music Director\n- Places: Gujarat\n\nFacts:\n- Kalyanji Virji Shah was born on 30 June 1928 and died on 03 November 2000.\n- Anandji Virji Shah was born on 02 March 1933.\n- Kalyanji Virji Shah and Anandji Virji Shah were brothers from Gujarat who formed the Indian composer duo Kalyanji–Anandji.\n- Kalyanji–Anandji were a Bollywood composer duo.\n- The Kalyanji–Anandji discography is the discography of the Bollywood composer duo Kalyanji–Anandji.\n- Anandji Virji Shah and his brother won the 1975 Filmfare Award for Best Music Director for \"Kora Kagaz\".",
